  "description": "Change of use from B8 to use for vehicle servicing, vehicular storage, vehicle display, offices and body shop AND changes to elevations including two vehicle entrances, entrance doors, fire exits and other fenestration, vents on roof and satellite dish. (Duplicate application)",
