  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is occupied.",
    "Condition : 3 - The carrying out of repairs, maintenance or other works to any vehicle, or the storage of vehicles or of parts, shall not take place outside of the building hereby permitted.",
    "Condition : 4 - The display and/or sale of vehicles shall not take place outside the building subject of this application.",
    "Condition : 5 - The parking, loading and turning spaces shown on drawing No. 660/194/07 shall be constructed and available for use before first occupation of any part of the development and such spaces shall not be used for any other purposes.",
    "Condition : 6 - The access doorways to the bulding shall have a minimum clear width of 900mm, a level surface or ramp between the pavement and the floor and a door handle of not more than 1m above ground level.",
    "Condition : 7 - The use shall not commence until a scheme for control of emissions from the bodyshop  including details of sound attenuation for any necessary plant has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority in writing."
  ],
